   "text": "Clark University - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nClark University\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nClark University was founded in 1887 as the first all-graduate institution in the country. At Clark, students study the world while being immersed in it. Students wrestle with complex ideas, and consider new and unfamiliar perspectives. A graduate degree from Clark University’s School of Management, Department of International Development, Community, and Environment, Becker School of Design and Technology, or the School of Professional Studies delivers intellectual growth, enhanced career satisfaction, and a lifetime of increased earnings and fulfilling employment opportunities. U.S. News &amp; World Report ranks Clark University: No. 103, “Best National Universities”No. 27 in the U.S. for “Best Value Schools”2021 “Best Business School ”Princeton Review recognizes Clark University as a“ Best College”&nbsp;No. 3 for “Schools Making an Impact”#18 for Happiest Students, and in 2019 Clark was named a Best Business School\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n25/06/2026 07:09\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 07:22\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$60,000.00\nMin: US$40,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n15%\n495 of 3,300 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1887\nCampus(es)\nWorcester\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n28/04/2026\nContract End Date\n27/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CCgEpeC2XVM\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7egh9xW_2V8\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WnADuNwHj-8\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oVjyFtHZkFM\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\nPlease note that at undergraduate level, only the School of Professional Studies degree completion programmes are offered.",
